<h1>System Menu (Inspection Mode)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>The System menu gives access to various system settings. This menu is divided in 2 sections:</p>
<table cellspacing="0" class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<col class="whs6">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="215px" class="whs8">
