<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.238%" class="whs22">
<p class="Command"><span class="Command">Hardware Settings</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="71.925%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Hardware dialog. The options in it depends on the sensor connected to the scanning system. Currently available are:</p>
<p class="normal-table">MMD -<a href="../../Scanning/Hardware/MMD/Settings/hardware_settings_mmd.htm" target="_self"><img src="../../User_Interface/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs24" alt=""></a>; &#160;&#160;MMZ -<a href="../../Scanning/Hardware/MMZ/Settings/hardware_settings_mmz.htm" target="_self"><img src="../../User_Interface/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs24" alt=""></a>; &#160;&#160;MMX -<a href="../../Scanning/Hardware/MMX/Settings/hardware_settings_mmx.htm" target="_self"><img src="../../User_Interface/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs24" alt=""></a>; MMC - <a href="../../Scanning/Hardware/MMC/Settings/Hardware_Settings_MMC.htm" target="_self"><img src="../../User_Interface/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs25" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="10.836%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.238%" class="whs22">
<p class="Command"><span class="Command">Preferences</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="71.925%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Preferences dialog.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="10.836%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../../References/display_settings.htm" target="_self"><img src="../../User_Interface/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs24" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.238%" class="whs22">
<p class="Command"><span class="Command">Shortcut Keys</span></p>
</td>
<td width="71.925%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">Calls the Shortcut Keys dialog.</p>
</td>
<td width="10.836%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../../User_Interface/Shortcut_Keys.htm" target="_self"><img src="../../User_Interface/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs24" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
