<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.23%" class="whs34">
<p class="Command"><span class="Command">PC Diagnostics</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="71.809%" class="whs35">
<p class="normal-table">To check the specification of your PC against the requirements of KUBE. The information displayed can be stored as a text file and sent to your local Marketing Partner to assist in fault-finding.</p>
